# LF in the repository and in every working tree. Git for Windows sets
# core.autocrlf=true by default, which rewrites text files to CRLF on
# checkout; this project has already paid for that once — hot.ts carries a
# CRLF fix because a bundle patch authored with Windows line endings would
# not parse (docs/design/2026-08-31-market-borrowings.md).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Byte-for-byte fixtures: a tarball or image that got eol-converted would
# fail in a way that does not name line endings.
*.png binary
*.tgz binary
